        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Markus Feehily, Bobby Fuller\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, guitarist\n- Songs: \"Love's Made a Fool of You\", \"I Fought the Law\"\n- Groups: The Bobby Fuller Four\n\nFacts:\n- Bobby Fuller was born on October 22, 1942, and died on July 18, 1966.\n- Markus Feehily, formerly known as Mark Feehily, was born on 28 May 1980.\n- Bobby Fuller was an American rock singer, songwriter, and guitarist.\n- Bobby Fuller was best known for \"Love's Made a Fool of You\" and for his cover of \"I Fought the Law\" recorded with The Bobby Fuller Four.\n- Markus Feehily is an Irish singer and songwriter.",
